{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Valiance</i></strong> is a fast-paced FPS that combines elements from Hero Shooters like Overwatch or Paladins with elements Boomer Shooters like Ultrakill or Doom Eternal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey, you will go from a mere beginner to a valiant hero who cannot be stopped. But be warned... Victory isn\u00b4t simply handed to you. Because the sweetest victory is earned with blood, sweat and tears.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.poster.avif?t=1754816206\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.webm?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/e9cf130317dc498a4eab8cca55972093.mp4?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Create your own character</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Valiance you can create your own character and decide your own playstyle. Choose from a variety of weapons and abilities and create a character you love or a craft a new one fit for your current challenge. You can create a character to suit your playstyle preferences or theory craft to create the strongest character to defeat whatever foe you are facing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.poster.avif?t=1754816206\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.webm?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/2ced18fad5e4ff188f32cb730d6e8258.mp4?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fast paced Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valiance features challenging fast paced FPS gameplay similar to what you\u00b4ll find in games like Doom Eternal, Paladins, Overwatch or Ultrakill. Chain together ability combos, dodge enemy projectiles and slice through your enemies.<br>(Bonus points for skillful weapon switching)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.poster.avif?t=1754816206\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.webm?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/459e180bdbceeed690008cd3866a3fc5.mp4?t=1754816206\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Scoring</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Valiance </strong>encourages replayability and rewards skillful gameplay by giving players scores at the end of each run based on factors like difficulty. This way YOU can show your friends, that YOU are the greatest hero of them all. If you desire, you can fine tune your character or test your skills, challenging yourself chasing high scores for hours on end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/266f63911c66f63c568e9c8b4205af3f.poster.avif?t=1754816206\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664580/extras/266f63911c66f63c568e9c8b4205af3f.webm?t=1754816206\" type=\"v